Chapter: AssumeVisible

 Policy probe: assume is the documented axiom escape hatch and must
 be VISIBLE - each use is expected to emit CDX4021 so axioms appear
 in the trust trail. Compile must succeed; the audit checks the log
 for the warning.

Section: Types

  Nat =
   | Zero
   | Succ (Nat)

Section: Proofs

  ax : Zero === Succ Zero
  ax = assume

Section: Main

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   print-line-uni "assume compiles"
  end
